# Expanded: opening, closing, timeouts, and how alerts behave around it (PS §3.3).

scenario: click expands compact, click again collapses
start media                         -> Compact
click                               -> Expanded expanded=media
click                               -> Compact

scenario: clicking idle does nothing
click                               -> Idle

scenario: expanded closes on outside click, Esc and idle timeout
start media
click                               -> Expanded
outside                             -> Compact
click                               -> Expanded
esc                                 -> Compact
click                               -> Expanded
wait 7999                           -> Expanded
wait 1                              -> Compact

scenario: pointer movement keeps expanded open
start media
click
wait 5000
pointer
wait 5000                           -> Expanded
wait 3000                           -> Compact

scenario: ending the shown activity collapses expanded
start media
start timer
click                               -> Expanded expanded=timer
end timer                           -> Compact

scenario: alerts wait while expanded
start media
click                               -> Expanded
alert copied                        -> Expanded queue=1
outside                             -> Alert alert=copied queue=0

scenario: critical interrupts expanded
start media
click
alert battery-low critical          -> Alert alert=battery-low

scenario: clicking an alert opens its activity
start media
start meeting                       -> top=meeting
alert song for=media                -> Alert
click                               -> Expanded expanded=media

scenario: clicking a standalone alert with nothing to open dismisses it
alert copied                        -> Alert
click                               -> Idle
